# --- llm-wiki vault (root = this project root) ---
# wiki/ and raw/ are tracked knowledge artifacts. Two exceptions:
#   wiki/graph/  regenerated by `graphify export obsidian` -- derived, not source
#   .obsidian/workspace*  machine-local pane layout, not vault config
wiki/graph/
.obsidian/workspace*
.obsidian/plugins/
